  "details": "For some odd reason that others don't seem to be able to repro, whenever I receive a log with \"scroll\" enabled, it ignores the latest line and only scrolls up to the 2nd furthest line down... I always have to look back at the window and scroll down myself to actually see the latest line that has appeared.\n\nI believe this occurs for multi-line debugs as well: it scrolls down to the 2nd latest line, but never far enough to reveal the last line of the log.\n\nExample: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FEX13XPsY9k&feature=youtu.be",
